From 2c5de27dd8e1911122ca15fd5bc445ad7cf03205 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 11:17:51 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add a paged playlist contents command

Opening a big playlist sent every track in one message, so the first open was slow
and the listing held thousands of items it was not showing.

music/playlists/playlist_tracks_page takes limit, offset, order_by and search. In
provider order without a search it stops reading the provider as soon as the page is
full; any other order, or a search, reads everything first because the contents are
not in the database. The existing playlist_tracks command is unchanged, so playback
and other clients are unaffected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
